Z = {}
def z(slug, *ps): Z[slug] = list(ps)
z('cooling-tower-supply-erection',
 ('What to share for an accurate quotation','A cooling tower quotation is only as good as the data behind it. Share the heat load or circulating flow, the hot and cold water temperatures you need, the site location (so the design wet-bulb can be set), available plot space, height limits and the water source. With these figures Seamens can size the tower, select the fill type and fan, and give a realistic delivery and erection timeline.'),
 ('Replacing an existing tower','Where an old tower is being replaced, Seamens can often reuse the basin or foundations after inspection, reducing civil work and shutdown time. Fill and nozzle replacement alone may restore much of the lost performance in towers whose structure is still sound.'))
z('monitoring-controls',
 ('A practical upgrade path','Many plants start with a simple step, such as a dosing pump and a conductivity controller on the boiler or cooling tower, and add online pH, flow-proportional dosing and SCADA links later. Each step pays for itself through steadier treatment, less wasted blow-down and fewer manual tests, so the system can grow with your budget.'),
 ('Who maintains it','Seamens supplies the equipment, installs it, sets the control points and trains operators on calibration and daily checks.'))
z('plant-erection-installation',
 ('From delivery to start-up','A typical installation runs through receiving and inspecting equipment, setting it on prepared foundations, levelling and grouting, aligning drives, connecting pipework and utilities, pressure testing, and finally the pre-commissioning checklist. Planning these steps in advance, with the right cranes, materials and people ready on the day, keeps the project short and avoids costly idle time for contractors and production staff.'),
 ('Working with equipment suppliers','Seamens coordinates with machine suppliers so their installation requirements are met.'))
z('reverse-osmosis-ro-plants',
 ('Calculating running cost','The true cost of an RO plant includes power for high-pressure pumps, chemicals, cartridge filters, membrane replacement and concentrate disposal. A well-designed plant with good pre-treatment and the right recovery keeps these costs low. Seamens shares the expected running cost figures with the proposal so you can compare options on lifetime cost, not purchase price alone.'),
 ('Space and utilities','Skid-mounted plants fit compact plant rooms with simple power and drain connections.'))
z('captive-power-plant-support',
 ('Routine site support','Support usually includes regular site visits to test feed water, boiler water, steam and cooling water, review dosing and blow-down, inspect chemical stocks and pumps, and discuss trends with the plant chemist or shift engineers. Clear monthly reports make it easy for management to see that water chemistry is under control and to plan any corrective work at the next outage.'),
 ('Emergency help','When water chemistry upsets occur, fast advice limits damage.'))
z('textile-machinery-parts',
 ('Why genuine fit matters','A heald frame, reed or picker stick that is slightly out of specification can cause warp damage, irregular picks or premature wear on neighbouring parts. Supplying parts that match the original dimensions and material protects both fabric quality and the machine. Seamens checks part references and dimensions before supply so the part fits first time on your rapier, projectile or air-jet looms, spinning frames or stenters.'),
 ('Ordering made simple','Send a WhatsApp photo of the part and machine plate for a quick identification.'))
z('ecoshield-wp',
 ('Preparing fabric for repellent finishing','Water repellent finishes are very sensitive to residues. Wetting agents, softeners and detergents left from earlier processes can attract water and spoil the spray rating. For best results, fabric should be well washed and neutral before finishing, and the finishing bath should be free of incompatible auxiliaries. Seamens reviews the full process route during the trial so the finish performs as intended on the first bulk lot.'))
z('industrial-spare-parts',
 ('Building a critical spares list','Start by listing equipment whose failure would stop production or create a safety risk, such as boiler feed pumps, cooling water pumps, key valves and heat exchangers. For each, note the parts most likely to fail and the lead time to replace them. Keeping those parts on the shelf, and reviewing the list every year, turns a potential multi-day stop into a short repair.'),
 ('Supply across Pakistan','Parts are dispatched from Lahore to sites across Pakistan.'))
z('ecowet-det',
 ('Where a combined product helps most','Mills that run many short batches of different fabrics often find that several preparation products sit half-used in the store. A combined wetting agent and detergent can replace two items in many recipes, simplifying stock control and reducing the chance that the wrong drum is used on a night shift. The trial confirms whether it can fully replace the separate products in each of your recipes.'))
z('industrial-chiller-systems',
 ('Comparing chiller offers fairly','When comparing chiller offers, look beyond price and nominal tonnage. Compare efficiency at full and part load, refrigerant type, compressor type, condenser design, service access, spare parts availability and the support offered after installation. Seamens provides these details in its proposals so decisions are made on lifetime value and reliability, not first cost alone.'))
z('industrial-air-humidification',
 ('Planning a humidification project','A project starts with measuring current temperature and humidity across the hall through the day, noting where conditions vary most and how many machines are running. From this, the system type, number of nozzles or units, water treatment and control layout are designed. Seamens then installs, commissions and trains your staff so the system holds steady conditions season after season.'))
z('ecoguard-fp',
 ('Planning a fire-safe textile order','Start by confirming who sets the requirement, whether a building authority, insurer or buyer, and which test standard they accept. Share fabric type, weight and end use with Seamens so the treatment and process can be matched. Treated samples are then tested before bulk, and test reports are kept with the order so you can show compliance whenever asked.'))
z('eco-silsoftner-glazer',
 ('Measuring the gain','Record warp breaks per shift, loom efficiency and fly collection for a baseline week, then repeat with the glazer in the recipe. Comparing the figures shows the real benefit in your mill, and helps decide which constructions benefit most. Seamens reviews the results with your weaving and sizing managers.'))
z('ecofix-fb',
 ('When to choose another fixer','If a buyer\'s restricted substance list sets very low formaldehyde limits, a formaldehyde-free fixing approach may be needed. Seamens can discuss options with you for those orders, while EcoFix-FB remains a practical choice for orders where it complies.'))
z('ecolevel-lv',
 ('Working with your dye recipe','Levelling agents are chosen for the dye class, fibre and machine. Share the recipe, liquor ratio and temperature profile so Seamens can advise the right dose and stage of addition for consistent results.'))
z('eco-silsoftner-hydrophobic',
 ('Running a fair trial','Finish a trial lot alongside your current softener and let the buyer\'s merchandiser compare handles blind. A side-by-side comparison on the same fabric is the clearest way to judge the improvement.'))
z('ecostab-hs',
 ('Water testing first','Testing process water for hardness, iron and copper helps set the right stabiliser dose. Seamens can arrange this before the trial.'),)
z('ecopva-gs',
 ('Trial plan','Trial on one fine-count or synthetic construction first, measure yarn strength, abrasion and loom breaks, then extend.'))
